1
00:00:00,427 --> 00:00:02,157
(Zack:)Penny?

2
00:00:02,162 --> 00:00:03,392
Oh. Zack, hi!

3
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:04,667
(Penny:)You guys remember Zack.

4
00:00:04,665 --> 00:00:05,795
(Howard:)Yeah, hey, buddy.
- Hello. - Hey.

5
00:00:05,799 --> 00:00:07,669
(Zack:)Hey, did you two
get married?

6
00:00:07,668 --> 00:00:08,968
(Penny:)We did.
Yeah, mm-hmm.

7
00:00:08,969 --> 00:00:11,199
(Zack:)To each other?

8
00:00:12,472 --> 00:00:13,902
Yes. (chuckles)

9
00:00:13,907 --> 00:00:16,107
Cool. 'Cause other than
when you broke up with him

10
00:00:16,109 --> 00:00:17,809
(Zack:)and dated me, then
broke up with me,

11
00:00:17,811 --> 00:00:20,741
(Zack:)and then dated me one more
time before going back to him,

12
00:00:20,747 --> 00:00:22,717
(Zack:)I was always rooting
for you two.

13
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:24,346
(Raj:)Thanks.

14
00:00:24,351 --> 00:00:25,851
(Zack:)So how's the
science world?

15
00:00:25,853 --> 00:00:27,283
(Penny:)What are you
guys up to?

16
00:00:27,287 --> 00:00:29,687
W-We've actually been
working on a prototype

17
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,220
(Howard:)for a navigation
system we invented.

18
00:00:31,225 --> 00:00:33,025
(Leonard:)But we won't bore you
with the details.

19
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:35,196
(Zack:)Are you kidding?
I love science.

20
00:00:35,195 --> 00:00:38,795
(Zack:)Einstein, Stephen Hawking,
Mike deGrasse Tyson.

21
00:00:39,666 --> 00:00:41,796
(Amy:)Mike deGrasse Tyson?

22
00:00:41,802 --> 00:00:44,502
(Howard:)Yeah, you know,
the boxer who grew a mustache

23
00:00:44,504 --> 00:00:47,104
(Howard:)and became a scientist.

24
00:00:47,107 --> 00:00:48,377
(Zack:)So what's your
invention?

25
00:00:48,375 --> 00:00:51,575
(Howard:)Well, we're using
quantum vortices

26
00:00:51,578 --> 00:00:53,778
(Howard:)to replace gyroscopes
in guidance systems.

27
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,480
(Leonard:)What's neat is
that they can maintain

28
00:00:55,482 --> 00:00:57,152
(Leonard:)angular momentum indefinitely.

29
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:59,350
(Leonard:)Angular momentum.

